          { "type": "text", "text": " fill the gaps between each butterfly." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What you need" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            { "name": "Lace weight yarn (white or ecru)", "qty": "90 m" },
            { "name": "3.5 mm crochet hook", "qty": "1" },
            { "name": "Tapestry needle", "qty": "1" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Centre" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Magic ring. Round 1: ch 3, 17 tr (18 tr). Round 2: ch 4, skip 2, *tr, ch 3; repeat from * (6 ch-3 spaces for 6 butterfly positions)." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Butterfly rounds (3 to 6)" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Round 3: work upper wings (5 tr into ch-3 space, ch 5, 5 tr) for each position. Round 4: work body treble at the centre between upper wings, then lower wings (3 tr, ch 3, 3 tr) below the body. Round 5: chain arcs linking wing tips. Round 6: work between-motif arcs of chain 6 between each butterfly, picot at the butterfly outer tips." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Fasten off and weave in the end. Block flat, pinning the wing tips out carefully." }]
      }
    ]
  }
